# Supabase Configuration for Sanjay & Simran Wedding Guestbook
# If you don't have Supabase configured yet, the website operates seamlessly in Local Mode.
# To connect a Supabase project:
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Run the SQL schema provided in README.md
# 3. Add your project URL and Anon Key below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
